  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="commodity_mirrour_cb88606e3e09e9e08b81aad95f9b02d6ac39a5c03418f043d66c2978ad97c4d4de">
    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>mirror (see also speculum) | mirror, large (see also speculum) | mirror | small mirror (see also mirrours) | mirror (see also mirrour) | presumably some sort of decorated mirror, a pinnacle being a projection suggesting the form of an ornamental turret on a cup, bird cage or crown (MED s.v. pinacle) | mirror (see also myrrourz) | mirror (see also mirrours)</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
    <crm:P2_has_type rdf:resource="http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435416"/>
